			"notes": "Fixes local shield design saving and loading.\n\n- Save Local Design no longer depends on the server-synchronized held item\n- Shield designs are also saved when the Xenon menu closes\n- Save failures now show an error instead of a false success message\n- Fixes the Minecraft 1.21.11 ShieldSpecialRenderer mixin signature\n- Fixes a crash when dragging over the lower or right edge of the 16x16 editor\n- Remains fully client-side; no server mod required\n\nMinecraft 1.21.11 | Fabric Loader 0.19.3 | Fabric API 0.141.5+1.21.11 | Java 21\nSHA-256: E9470AF72DB6160E8EE03C4CE928EA07DD4C95B2DEAED46DE6EF40001DBCAB1E\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Laserraphael2/client-template-1.21.11/compare/v1.1.1...v1.1.2"
